    "text": "Consider the following ionization enthalpies of two elements &#39;A&#39; and &#39;B&#39;.<br />&nbsp;<table border=\"1\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>Element</td>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"3\">Ionization enthalphy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>kJ</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>mol</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>1</mn><mi>st</mi></msup></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>nd</mi></msup></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>rd</mi></msup></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A</td>\t\t\t<td>899</td>\t\t\t<td>1757</td>\t\t\t<td>14847</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B</td>\t\t\t<td>737</td>\t\t\t<td>1450</td>\t\t\t<td>7731</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><br /><br />Which of the following statements is correct?",
